      "id": "malayalam-voice-checks-off-todo-items",
      "title": "Malayalam voice commands check off to-do items",
      "dek": "Home Assistant recognizes requests to complete a named task, building on Malayalam commands for adding items to a list.",
      "body": [
        "Home Assistant’s Malayalam sentence rules recognize requests to check off a named item on a named to-do list. The response repeats the completed item’s name, confirming which task was handled.",
